{
  "slug": "drupal-boost",
  "name": "Drupal Boost",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Comprehensive Drupal 11 development toolkit: module scaffolding, theme development, configuration management, migration, security auditing, testing, deployment, and more. Supports DDEV and Lando.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **13 skills**, **6 agents**, **8 commands** and **3 hooks**.\n\n- **Skills** (13): `caching-strategy` (Drupal cache API patterns including cache tags, cache contexts, max-age, render caching, and cache invalidation strategies), `config-management` (Drupal configuration management including config export/import, Config Split, environment-specific configuration, and config override patterns), `contrib-publishing` (Publishing contributed modules to drupal.org including coding standards, documentation requirements, GitLab CI templates, and the module review process), `ddev-workflow` (DDEV and Lando-based Drupal development workflow including setup, commands, add-ons (Solr, Redis, Elasticsearch, Mailpit), Drush via DDEV/Lando, testing,…), `deployment` (Drupal deployment workflows, CI/CD pipeline configuration (GitHub Actions, GitLab CI), Composer management, and deployment order (database updates, config…), `drupal-security` (Drupal security best practices, vulnerability prevention, permissions and access control, input sanitization, and the Access Policy API), `migrate-api` (Drupal Migrate API for ETL data migration including source plugins, process plugins, destination plugins, migration groups, and migration…), `module-scaffold` (Scaffolds Drupal 11 modules with services, plugins, controllers, forms, routing, event subscribers, OOP Hook attributes, Entity/Field API, Queue/Batch…), and 5 more\n- **Agents** (6): `drupal-architect` (Designs Drupal 11 module and feature architectures), `drupal-explorer` (Deep Drupal codebase analysis agent), `drupal-migration-analyst` (Analyzes source data and designs Drupal migration strategies), `drupal-reviewer` (Reviews Drupal code for coding standards compliance, Drupal API best practices, deprecated API usage, and Drupal-specific anti-patterns), `drupal-security-auditor` (Performs deep security audits of Drupal code checking for XSS vulnerabilities, SQL injection, access bypass, CSRF issues, insecure…), `drupal-test-runner` (Runs and analyzes Drupal tests, identifies failures, and suggests fixes)\n- **Commands** (8): `boost-feature` (Full 7-phase feature development workflow for Drupal 11 with parallel agents for exploration, architecture, and review), `boost-migration` (Guided migration builder with source data analysis and Drupal Migrate API YAML generation), `boost-module` (Guided multi-phase module scaffolding for Drupal 11 with exploration, architecture design, and quality review), `boost-recipe` (Scaffold a Drupal Recipe for automating module installation and configuration), `boost-theme` (Guided theme creation with Single Directory Component scaffolding for Drupal 11), `deploy-check` (Pre-deployment readiness check for Drupal projects), `quality-check` (Run full code quality suite (PHPCS, PHPStan, Drupal Check) on custom Drupal code), `security-audit` (Run a comprehensive security audit on the current Drupal project covering XSS, SQL injection, access bypass, CSRF, and…)\n- **Hooks** (3): `SessionStart`, `PreToolUse`, `PostToolUse`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install drupal-boost@claude-community` from `abderrahimghazali/drupal-boost`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
